{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "157abddf6e09297d4998550a0ea21f8242750606b72faac60cda9d826cecfa10", "ja": "（亜利沙？　新しい衣装のフィッティング中\nみたいだけど、なんだかブツブツ言っているな）", "zh": "（亚利沙？好像正在试穿新服装，不过她好像在嘟嘟囔囔地说着什么。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "95a2ed1d89cdf9c99ea7a687994320396e2b652428a5fe51a2e011fd2aecc080", "ja": "うふふっ、ごきげんよう？\nお会いできて、光栄でしてよ……おほほ。", "zh": "呵呵，您好呀？\n能与您相见，真是荣幸之至呢……哦呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "a5385bb8b385d1c80b0140377dd25b21501b57b38ff715927db866c9221169fb", "ja": "ワタクシと踊ってくださいませんか？\nさあ、この手をお取りになって……。", "zh": "您愿意和我一起跳舞吗？\n来，请牵起我的手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d1a6cb4cd1739fa42ff336a82b562c9256d3fdb472131861af13bbfd1c1906ed", "ja": "……えっと、亜利沙？　ダンスがしたいのか？", "zh": "……那个，亚利沙？你想跳舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "39b163e40b32fbcbf2f1bd6eef12f2ecb77b04cf691aad2b3bfab3d7661901a7", "ja": "はうあっ！？　{$P$}さん！\nい、いつからそこに……！？", "zh": "啊呜！？{$P$}先生！\n你、你什么时候来的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1005_p", "source_sha256": "098719496c052fb7fc7bf330c8e3df36c57978bd01da5e668a3e7e53c394b170", "ja": "いや、たった今だけど。\nダンスレッスンしたいなら、予約入れておこうか？", "zh": "不是，我也是刚刚才到。  \n你想上舞蹈课的话，要不要我帮你预约？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "d89019acc91e0bed78fe6bb0fef8f742f441a78f7146d59a31434985ef38bd3c", "ja": "い、いえ、そういうのではなく！　こ、これは、\nイメージトレーニングと言うか、妄想と言うか……。", "zh": "不、不是那样的！这、这个该说是\n意象训练呢，还是妄想呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "9661d63f150152dee0160edfc184709685c82f2fb01eb7f35cc14e842922bdd8", "ja": "うぅ……こ、ここはスルーしてくれないと\nダメなとこですよぉ！　やぁ～んっ！", "zh": "呜呜……这、这种地方必须\n装作没看见才行啦！讨厌啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1008_p", "source_sha256": "44edc64bb49d3839f74764d40705c1338eca3300db0507e1d05db5e9bd5cd2de", "ja": "あ、そうか、ゴメン……ええと。\nその衣装、どうだろう？　気に入ってくれたか？", "zh": "啊，这样啊，对不起……那个。\n那套服装怎么样？你喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "f95a684be8cfeeed0e7c92dcf71e91d3c26a4a83e4164094b3995b536e731309", "ja": "そ、それはもちろん、最高ですっ！　思わず、\nイメージトレーニングしてしまうほどに……あはは。", "zh": "那、那当然是最棒的！简直让我忍不住做起了形象训练……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "80a74aab0ca51236237aa33cb3381e67838d853847caa7a16f1549b4af8ad1b2", "ja": "こんなに素敵なドレスを着られるなんて、\nなんだか夢みたいで、現実感がありませんケド。", "zh": "能穿上这么漂亮的礼服，感觉就像在做梦一样，都没有真实感了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "bf898a22cb8bc6848844197e0407b09b2116be1a917fcfc5a00c09c6442aa9ba", "ja": "たっぷりのフリルやリボンが、\n童話に出てくるお姫様みたいで……ムフフ。", "zh": "满满的褶边和蝴蝶结，简直就像童话里的公主一样……呜呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5624e131f28dc3d922b1e9579f8d735b1f8cec75ac1047b31d5bb7a7ea44fc96", "ja": "そうだな。それに、その髪型もいいじゃないか。\nよく似合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。而且，你这个发型也很不错嘛。\n我觉得很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "c048d9a546965075448bfb65e37692d05de704250651477ce0191b83af9cf38a", "ja": "そうですか！？　えへへ……よかったです♪\n思い切って、ありさの憧れを詰め込んでみました！", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿……太好了♪  \n我鼓起勇气，把有里纱憧憬的一切都融进去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "51adf9aec63867a7a125528b104b45286ef0c0fe9d3603a5d6ff0dced7627ac3", "ja": "でも、見た目ばっかりで、中身がいつものありさだと、\n台無しですよね？　だからイメトレをしないと……！", "zh": "可是，如果光是外表，内在还是平时的亚利沙，那就全毁了吧？所以得做形象训练才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5ee368a53abb753c39e416c547a500b646ea31ecb5f1d6c83b0725627c9fc484", "ja": "え？　いや、そんなことないと思うけど……。\nどうしてそう思うんだ？", "zh": "诶？不，我觉得没那回事吧……\n你为什么会这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "baf60a78e6c036950df82db90155d9494389f2f309b2097160cd3b5ebb7340e6", "ja": "だ、だって……ありさ、お姫様っぽくありませんよぉ！\n気品もないですし、「ふおぉぉ！」とか言うし……。", "zh": "可、可是……亚利沙一点都不像公主嘛！\n既没有气质，还会说“呜哦哦哦！”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ed66357bbe43616f48106f1ab068bc4b02a446f6c65c0e7c51d93dc453b28156", "ja": "うーん……？　「ふおぉぉ！」って言う\nお姫様がいても、いいと思うんだけどなぁ。", "zh": "嗯……？我觉得，就算有会说“呜哦哦哦！”的公主，也没什么不好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "1871b8592fe6258bb23c02e5fe3e51546005c5e1c1fc66715f2a8de6a8410744", "ja": "えっ。で、でも……？", "zh": "咦？可、可是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1019_p", "source_sha256": "021c0efdc8b985a0630b1f0f5cdd09111a710badeb77d4cfc037b1ea241eef61", "ja": "親しみやすくて、元気いっぱいで……みんなと一緒に\n笑ってくれるお姫様っていうのも、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "亲切随和、活力满满……能和大家一起\n开怀大笑的公主，这样不也挺好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4d5712dc00839c41956ca146a9d6d0df84732b2af3affcd78ed052137beaeedc", "ja": "上品さとか、落ち着きとか。そういうのばかりが、\nお姫様の条件じゃないと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得，优雅、沉稳之类的，也不是成为公主的唯一条件。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "441c423a02a7268be0147ceb784be21355e652a8cf047d4747cf8ac9b004cd62", "ja": "{$P$}さん……は、はいっ！\nありさも……ありさも、そう思います！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……是、是的！\n亚利沙……亚利沙也这么认为！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "9611c3fed9529a637041790916bbab5bf410e0cebbfc32a9f52726f52da464e2", "ja": "そうですよね、アイドルちゃんのことを\n大好きなお姫様が、ひとりくらいいてもいいですよね！", "zh": "就是嘛，至少有一个最喜欢偶像的公主也没关系吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0294_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "f0f918c27bd04e239339ef560728ea9ec0dcc8b5a6af4d4f9b3d3b579de42064", "ja": "わかりましたっ！　ありさは迷わず、ありさらしい\nプリンセス道を進みますよぉ。ふおぉぉっ！", "zh": "我明白了！亚利沙会毫不犹豫地，走出属于亚利沙自己的\n公主之路的～。吼哦哦哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
